---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Benedict Interactive"
  description="Independent software by Benedict J. Thoughtful, useful, privacy-conscious apps with a brighter point of view."
>
  <section class="home-hero shell" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="home-hero-copy">
      <p class="home-kicker">Independent software studio · Benedict J.</p>

      <h1 id="home-title">
        Ideas for a
        <span class="home-gradient-text">brighter everyday.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="home-lead">
        One person making useful software with care, clarity, privacy, and a little
        personality. Small enough to stay thoughtful. Serious enough to sweat the details.
      </p>

      <div class="home-actions" aria-label="Homepage actions">
        <a class="home-button home-button-primary" href="#bearagnostic">
          Meet Bearagnostic <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="home-button home-button-secondary" href="/products">
          Explore products
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="home-proof" aria-label="Studio qualities">
        <span><i class="proof-dot proof-blue" aria-hidden="true"></i> One-person studio</span>
        <span><i class="proof-dot proof-cyan" aria-hidden="true"></i> Privacy-conscious</span>
        <span><i class="proof-dot proof-amber" aria-hidden="true"></i> Made with care</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-hero-art" aria-label="Benedict J. at his desk">
      <div class="hero-orb hero-orb-blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-orb hero-orb-violet" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="founder-card">
        <img
          src="/brand/benedict-j.webp"
          alt="Editorial illustration of Benedict J. smiling at his desk with a laptop and a sleeping dog"
          width="1440"
          height="810"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>

      <aside class="studio-note" aria-label="Studio note">
        <span class="studio-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <strong>Small studio.</strong>
        <span>Big care for the details.</span>
      </aside>

      <div class="founder-tag">
        <strong>Benedict J.</strong>
        <span>Independent developer</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-manifesto" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
    <div class="shell manifesto-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="home-kicker">The point of view</p>
        <h2 id="manifesto-title">Good software can be capable <em>and</em> cheerful.</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="manifesto-copy">
        Benedict Interactive keeps things intentionally small: fewer layers, clearer choices,
        honest states, and software that treats people like people. The personality is bright;
        the engineering stays serious.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-product shell" id="bearagnostic" aria-labelledby="bearagnostic-title">
    <div class="product-copy">
      <p class="home-kicker">Featured product</p>
      <h2 id="bearagnostic-title">Meet Bearagnostic.</h2>
      <p class="product-promise">
        Find clutter. Explain the risk. Clean with confidence.
      </p>
      <p class="product-description">
        A privacy-first Android file clarity assistant that helps you understand what is taking
        space before you remove it. No fake “boost” theatrics. Just useful information, clear
        choices, and a calmer cleanup.
      </p>

      <div class="product-chips" aria-label="Bearagnostic qualities">
        <span>Android</span>
        <span>Privacy-first</span>
        <span>Clear explanations</span>
      </div>

      <div class="home-actions product-actions">
        <a class="home-button home-button-primary" href="/products/bearagnostic">
          Explore Bearagnostic <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="home-text-link" href="/support">
          Support <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="product-gallery" aria-label="Bearagnostic product preview">
      <div class="product-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <figure class="app-frame">
        <img
          src="/products/bearagnostic/app-home.webp"
          alt="Bearagnostic home screen showing Start Checkup, cleanup tools, File Health, and the app navigation"
          width="691"
          height="1536"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>Real app screen</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="bear-brand-card">
        <img
          src="/products/bearagnostic/brand.webp"
          alt="Bearagnostic mascot wearing glasses and holding a tablet above the Bearagnostic wordmark"
          width="980"
          height="980"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>

      <figure class="bear-mascot-card" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="/products/bearagnostic/mascot.webp"
          alt=""
          width="820"
          height="852"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-values" aria-labelledby="values-title">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="values-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="home-kicker">How things get made</p>
          <h2 id="values-title">Independent by design.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Being small is useful. Decisions stay close to the product, details stay visible,
          and there is no committee between an idea and the person using it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="value-grid">
        <article class="value-card value-blue">
          <span class="value-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
          <h3>Useful first</h3>
          <p>Features earn their place by solving something real, not by filling a checklist.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card value-violet">
          <span class="value-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>
          <h3>Human by default</h3>
          <p>Clear language, comfortable interfaces, and enough personality to feel alive.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card value-green">
          <span class="value-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <h3>Trust is structural</h3>
          <p>Privacy and honest behavior matter more than persuasive decoration.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card value-amber">
          <span class="value-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
          <h3>Joy, with restraint</h3>
          <p>Color and playfulness are welcome when they make the experience better.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-studio shell" aria-labelledby="studio-title">
    <div class="studio-panel">
      <div class="studio-copy">
        <p class="home-kicker">Benedict Interactive</p>
        <h2 id="studio-title">Built by one person. Made for real people.</h2>
        <p>
          Benedict J. designs, builds, tests, and keeps improving the work here. That makes
          Benedict Interactive deliberately personal — not tiny for the sake of being tiny,
          but focused enough to care about the parts that larger products often smooth over.
        </p>
      </div>

      <blockquote>
        <p>“Make it useful. Make it clear. Leave a little room for delight.”</p>
        <footer>— Benedict J.</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-closing shell" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
    <div class="closing-spark closing-spark-a" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="closing-spark closing-spark-b" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <p class="home-kicker">What comes next</p>
    <h2 id="closing-title">Small ideas. Carefully made.</h2>
    <p>
      Bearagnostic is the first chapter. Benedict Interactive is the home for whatever useful,
      thoughtful thing deserves to come next.
    </p>
    <a class="home-button home-button-light" href="/products">
      See what’s being built <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .home-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.93fr) minmax(520px, 1.07fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.5rem);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: min(880px, calc(100svh - 70px));
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
  }

  .home-hero::before {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    left: -18%;
    z-index: -1;
    width: 38rem;
    height: 38rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61, 199, 255, 0.14), transparent 67%);
    content: "";
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .home-hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .home-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: #185ee0;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 840;
    letter-spacing: 0.17em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .home-hero h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #14213a;
    font-size: clamp(3.55rem, 7.25vw, 7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.062em;
    line-height: 0.94;
  }

  .home-gradient-text {
    display: block;
    color: #2479ff;
    background: linear-gradient(105deg, #1b64ef 2%, #258cff 48%, #38c7ef 95%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .home-lead {
    max-width: 660px;
    margin-top: 1.7rem;
    color: #5b687e;
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.55vw, 1.28rem);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .home-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.78rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .home-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 52px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.82rem 1.22rem;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 790;
    line-height: 1;
    transition:
      transform 170ms ease,
      box-shadow 170ms ease,
      border-color 170ms ease,
      background-color 170ms ease;
  }

  .home-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .home-button-primary {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #216fff, #3baeff);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(36, 121, 255, 0.24);
  }

  .home-button-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 22px 54px rgba(36, 121, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .home-button-secondary {
    color: #172033;
    border-color: rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.1);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(45, 68, 109, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }

  .home-proof {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: #667287;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 720;
  }

  .home-proof span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.46rem;
  }

  .proof-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .proof-blue { background: #2479ff; }
  .proof-cyan { background: #42c8ed; }
  .proof-amber { background: #ffb847; }

  .home-hero-art {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: clamp(480px, 44vw, 665px);
  }

  .founder-card {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 4% -9% -3% -6%;
    display: grid;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .founder-card::after {
    position: absolute;
    right: 4%;
    bottom: 4%;
    left: 14%;
    z-index: -1;
    height: 24%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(39, 92, 164, 0.12);
    content: "";
    filter: blur(34px);
  }

  .founder-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 40px rgba(37, 65, 107, 0.11));
  }

  .hero-orb {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(1px);
  }

  .hero-orb-blue {
    top: 9%;
    right: 2%;
    width: 70%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86), rgba(61, 199, 255, 0.2) 40%, rgba(36, 121, 255, 0.1) 68%, transparent 71%);
  }

  .hero-orb-violet {
    right: 32%;
    bottom: 3%;
    width: 42%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(128, 105, 255, 0.13), transparent 70%);
  }

  .studio-note {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 3;
    display: grid;
    max-width: 210px;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.05rem;
    color: #29354a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 46px rgba(39, 67, 110, 0.11);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }

  .studio-note-mark {
    color: #ffae34;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .studio-note strong {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .studio-note span:last-child {
    color: #657185;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .founder-tag {
    position: absolute;
    right: 3%;
    bottom: 3%;
    z-index: 3;
    display: grid;
    min-width: 175px;
    gap: 0.18rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.08);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(248, 251, 255, 0.86);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(45, 68, 109, 0.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  }

  .founder-tag strong {
    color: #16233d;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .founder-tag span {
    color: #738096;
    font-size: 0.69rem;
    font-weight: 680;
  }

  .home-manifesto {
    position: relative;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.06);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 40%, rgba(61, 199, 255, 0.09), transparent 26rem),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.56);
  }

  .manifesto-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(300px, 0.72fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .manifesto-grid h2,
  .home-product h2,
  .values-heading h2,
  .home-studio h2,
  .home-closing h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #172033;
    font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 5vw, 4.85rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.052em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .manifesto-grid h2 em {
    color: #2479ff;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .manifesto-copy {
    margin: 0;
    color: #657185;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.16rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .home-product {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.86fr) minmax(520px, 1.14fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7.5rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 10vw, 9rem);
  }

  .product-copy {
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .product-promise {
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
    color: #1d6df5;
    font-size: clamp(1.22rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);
    font-weight: 830;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .product-description {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    color: #657185;
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .product-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-top: 1.55rem;
  }

  .product-chips span {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    color: #435068;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.08);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 760;
  }

  .product-actions {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
  }

  .home-text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.38rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding-inline: 0.4rem;
    color: #1d65dc;
    font-weight: 790;
  }

  .product-gallery {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 680px;
  }

  .product-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 9% 3% 2%;
    z-index: -1;
    border-radius: 44%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 52% 44%, rgba(61, 199, 255, 0.25), rgba(36, 121, 255, 0.08) 42%, transparent 67%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 14% 82%, rgba(128, 105, 255, 0.1), transparent 45%);
    filter: blur(9px);
  }

  .app-frame {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 4%;
    z-index: 3;
    width: min(43%, 330px);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px;
    overflow: visible;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
    border-radius: 38px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow:
      0 32px 80px rgba(33, 75, 135, 0.18),
      0 8px 24px rgba(33, 75, 135, 0.08);
    transform: rotate(1.7deg);
  }

  .app-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 30px;
  }

  .app-frame figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    top: 22px;
    right: calc(100% - 8px);
    width: max-content;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.72rem;
    color: #526079;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.08);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(45, 68, 109, 0.09);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .bear-brand-card {
    position: absolute;
    top: 13%;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    width: min(49%, 365px);
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 34px;
    background: #040507;
    box-shadow: 0 26px 68px rgba(19, 31, 51, 0.2);
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
  }

  .bear-brand-card img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .bear-mascot-card {
    position: absolute;
    right: 25%;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 4;
    width: min(31%, 225px);
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: #050608;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 52px rgba(33, 61, 105, 0.17);
    transform: rotate(5deg);
  }

  .bear-mascot-card img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .home-values {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    border-block: 1px solid rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.06);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62), rgba(241, 247, 255, 0.78));
  }

  .values-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, 0.55fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
  }

  .values-heading > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #657185;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .value-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .value-card {
    min-height: 260px;
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(45, 68, 109, 0.07);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .value-symbol {
    display: grid;
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    place-items: center;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 15px;
    font-weight: 900;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(45, 68, 109, 0.12);
  }

  .value-blue .value-symbol { background: #2479ff; }
  .value-violet .value-symbol { background: #8069ff; }
  .value-green .value-symbol { background: #48bd83; }
  .value-amber .value-symbol { background: #ffb847; }

  .value-card h3 {
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0.7rem;
    color: #172033;
    font-size: 1.32rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .value-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #69768b;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .home-studio {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8.5rem);
  }

  .studio-panel {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, 0.72fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    border-radius: 42px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, rgba(61, 199, 255, 0.18), transparent 24rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 110%, rgba(128, 105, 255, 0.12), transparent 25rem),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(45, 68, 109, 0.09);
  }

  .studio-copy > p:last-child {
    max-width: 690px;
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
    color: #657185;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .studio-panel blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.6rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #3bb9f0;
    border-radius: 0 24px 24px 0;
    background: rgba(244, 249, 255, 0.84);
  }

  .studio-panel blockquote p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #25334c;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.7vw, 2.2rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.28;
  }

  .studio-panel blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: #6f7c91;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 760;
  }

  .home-closing {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    padding: clamp(3.8rem, 7vw, 6.2rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 42px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 22% 18%, rgba(61, 199, 255, 0.33), transparent 20rem),
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 110%, rgba(128, 105, 255, 0.32), transparent 24rem),
